---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Shaurya Vijay Sinha">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">B.Com (Hons), St. Xavier's College, Kolkata · 2025–2028</p>
      <h1>Shaurya Vijay Sinha</h1>
      <div class="prose" style="font-size:1.15rem; margin-top: var(--space-2);">
        <p>
          I build fiscal exposure models and write policy arguments that stand
          on them — mostly on credit guarantees, MSME finance, and where
          India's capital markets still leave good borrowers unfunded. The
          long-run aim is a seat in boutique investment banking, doing the
          same kind of work with sharper stakes.
        </p>
        <p>
          Alongside that: two years of consulting casework with Xavier's
          Consulting Club, live Detailed Project Reports for skilling and
          industrial clients, and published commentary in
          <em>Swarajya</em> and on Substack.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex; gap: var(--space-3); flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top: var(--space-3);">
        <a class="btn btn--solid" href="/experience/">View experience</a>
        <a class="btn" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/shaurya-vijay-sinha/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
        <a class="btn" href="https://substack.com/@shauryavijaysinha" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Substack</a>
        <a class="btn" href="https://swarajyamag.com/author/2460159/shaurya-vijay-sinha" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Swarajya</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="stat-strip">
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat__figure">₹15.02L Cr</span>
          <span class="stat__label">unpriced contingent liability gap modelled in CGTMSE's flat-rate pricing through FY30</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat__figure">15+</span>
          <span class="stat__label">national and state-level consulting case competitions, at Xavier's Consulting Club</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat__figure">2</span>
          <span class="stat__label">Detailed Project Reports co-authored for skilling and industrial-sector clients</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat__figure">₹4 Cr</span>
          <span class="stat__label">pilot financial framework designed for a proposed Centre of Excellence</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Where to look next</h2>
      <div class="card-grid" style="margin-top: var(--space-3);">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Experience</h3>
          <p>Research at NFPRC, consulting at Xavier's Consulting Club, and two live client engagements — set out role by role.</p>
          <a href="/experience/">Read the record →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Research</h3>
          <p>Two fiscal models, written up as case studies: an AI credit guarantee proposal, and a risk-pricing critique of CGTMSE.</p>
          <a href="/research/">Open the case studies →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Writing</h3>
          <p>Published commentary on growth, industrial policy, and economic history — in Swarajya and on Substack.</p>
          <a href="/writing/">Browse the pieces →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
